@startuml schedule_run_admission
' Java baseline: 553dcd5e2ff682f9684810a043b442b37a02e54a; main fetched 2026-10-08 (unchanged).
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/session/AgentSessionFactory.java create.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeMessageEventService.java submitLocked.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/persistence/RuntimeExecutionPersistenceService.java acceptMessage.
' Presentation: Schedule coordinates the transaction; Runtime provides preparation and persistence capabilities.
' Design reason: remote grant checks finish before the short acceptance transaction.
' PR evidence: e9d31e8888a81b7fe95071e705482bb16fa10476, fetched 2026-10-10.
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/schedule/ScheduledRuntimeAdmissionService.java newSession and encodeContext.
' Java divergence: remove Claw user references; Mate ownership registration is Pending implementation.
' Target: Pending implementation; a reserved Run enters, a known admission result leaves; no execution here.
title Shared Run admission - prepare, then commit\n(Pending implementation)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant Schedule
participant Mate
participant Runtime
database Store
== Check current execution authority ==
Schedule -> Mate : Resolve trusted definitions, current grant\nand credential references for this Run
Mate --> Schedule : Execution context or rejection
break Execution context unavailable or rejected
  Schedule -> Store : Record failure only if task / Run still exist\nRelease only this Run's slot
  Store --> Schedule : Failure committed or deletion preserved
end
== Register independent ownership ==
Schedule -> Schedule : Fix the proposed Session ID for this Run
Schedule -> Mate : Register Session ownership by resource IDs and grant\nNo user / tenant / owner supplied by Claw
Mate --> Schedule : Durable binding confirmed, rejected or unknown
break Binding not confirmed
  Schedule -> Schedule : Stop admission; reconcile by fixed IDs\nDo not create another Session or replay business
end
== Prepare without executing ==
Schedule -> Runtime : Prepare Agent, model and CRON context\nReuse fixed Session ID; no business execution
Runtime --> Schedule : Fixed preparation snapshot or failure
alt Preparation succeeded
  group One short database transaction, coordinated by Schedule
    Schedule -> Store : Recheck task, claim, grant, time and capacity\nCreate Session + first message + root + Run link
    Store --> Schedule : Committed acceptance or known rejection
  end
else Preparation failed
  Schedule -> Store : Record failure only if task / Run still exist\nRelease only this Run's slot
  Store --> Schedule : Failure committed or deletion preserved
end
note over Schedule, Store
  Mate binding is independent; there is no cross-database transaction.
  A failed Claw transaction leaves a binding to reconcile, not a Session.
  Admission uses Runtime persistence inside the same transaction.
  An accepted Run keeps its prepared context for dispatch.
  No model or tool execution occurs in this sequence.
end note
@enduml
